# `out*/`, not `out-*/`: the default --prefix in CI and in the docs is a BARE `out/`, which the
# narrower pattern missed. A local build then leaves ~1200 files of installed ExecuTorch sitting
# untracked-but-not-ignored, where a `git add -A` sweeps them into a commit.
out*/
# The gate's ccache directory (full-aot job); must never be committed.
.ccache/
et-build/
spike/*.log
et-build-*/
etnp-extras-*/
.superpowers/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
